{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"closer\": \"Y\",\n  \"x_off\": [\n    \"S06-S09 将矛盾较多地转向了遇到难事时是否有人陪伴、自己能否承受孤独，容易把 Center 中对旧日生活及归属的怀念收窄成对陪伴和情感支持的需求。\",\n    \"S10 着重于反复梳理委屈与舍不得、试图想明白自己的感受，使主线一度偏向内心困惑和反刍，而不是尊严与归属之间的持续拉扯。\",\n    \"S11-S12 虽然重新回到不愿委屈自己与舍不得旧日生活的矛盾，但 X 对不因孤独而放弃尊严的行动表达相对间接。\"\n  ],\n  \"y_off\": [\n    \"S08 将矛盾部分转向回忆无法陪伴现实中的自己，S13 又延伸到未来能否遇见新的亲近关系，略微扩大了 Center 的范围，但没有取代原有主线。\"\n  ],\n  \"why\": \"Y 更直接地让两股力量相互牵制：他怀念的是被当作自己人的旧日归属，却不愿为了重新得到亲近而再次忍受委屈；即使孤独和回头的诱惑反复出现，也逐渐坚持不因害怕失去陪伴而放弃尊严。X 也包含两方面，但中段更容易把主线转成对孤独和陪伴的担忧。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "6aaef461-02f7-4063-bcaa-2c2c37796e0e", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261106T101347644338Z", "elapsed_seconds": 20.047, "completed_utc": "2026-11-06T10:14:07.708718+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "e4e4da52f6ec2f6c12e297e64b124f870f81ca3841688f728aaa8add74d5af2b", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1e